        "name": "markings",
        "html": "<div class=\"roll-table\" id=\"markings\"><div class=\"roll-table-head\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"dice-roll\" data-dice=\"1d6\" title=\"클릭하여 1d6 굴림 — Shift: 유리 · Ctrl: 불리\">1d6</button> <span class=\"roll-label\">표식</span></div><table><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">1-2</th><td>아무것도 찾을 수 없다</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">3</th><td>숨겨져 있고, 불완전하거나/훼손되었다</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">4</th><td>숨겨져 있고, 온전하다</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">5</th><td>뚜렷하지만 불완전하거나/훼손되었다</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">6</th><td>뚜렷하고 온전하다</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
