        "html": "<div class=\"roll-table\" id=\"what-brought-them\"><div class=\"roll-table-head\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"dice-roll\" data-dice=\"1d12\" title=\"클릭하여 1d12 굴림 — Shift: 유리 · Ctrl: 불리\">1d12</button> <span class=\"roll-label\">온 까닭</span></div><table><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">1-3</th><td>한밑천 잡으러</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">4-5</th><td>가족/친구와 합치려고</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">6-9</th><td>일이 틀어져 달리 갈 곳이 없어서</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">10</th><td>도망 중</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">11</th><td>우연, 운명, 얼떨결에</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">12</th><td>억지로 끌려와서</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
